-- replace Omarchy's defaults.

-- Keyboard layout and options.
-- See https://wiki.hypr.land/Configuring/Basics/Variables/#input

-- English (US) first so Hyprland's Latin-keysym keybindings (SUPER + W and
-- friends) resolve against it, Russian second. Caps Lock toggles between the
-- two (grp:caps_toggle) and no longer acts as the compose key; pressing both
-- shifts together still toggles Caps Lock.
hl.config({
  input = {
    kb_layout = "us,ru",
    kb_options = "grp:caps_toggle,shift:both_capslock_cancel",
  },
})

